    "media:imagetext": "WINE LIST\nYOUR FLIGHT ATTENDANT WILL INFORM YOU\nOF TODAY'S SELECTIONS.\nWE ARE PLEASED TO PRESENT AN ARRAY OF FINE WINES\nCAREFULLY SELECTED FOR THEIR EXCELLENCE BY UNITED'S\nCELLAR COMMITTEE UNDER THE GUIDANCE OF WINE JUDGE\nAND AUTHOR, BOB THOMPSON.\nSPARKLING WINE\nDomaine Chandon Napa Valley Brut\nWHITE WINES\nCalvet Chardonnay\nor\nAmberhill Chardonnay\nRED WINES\nBoisset Merlot\nOr\nLos Vascos Cabernet Sauvignon\nTO BEGIN\nTASTEFUL SAMPLING\nCrayfish Salad with roasted Bell Peppers\nGARDEN FRESH SALAD\nLollo Rossa, Frisée and Boston Lettuce\nwith Plum Tomatoes, julienned Carrots and Chives,\naccompanied by Balsamic Vinaigrette\nor Honey Peppercorn Dressing\n20280020\nM\nA\nIN COURSES\nMARINATED FILET MIGNON\nPopular nationwide,\nserved with traditional American Honey Mustard Sauce,\naccompanied by Angel Hair Pasta Frittata\nand sautéed Vegetables with toasted Sesame Seeds\nROSEMARY PAPPARDELLE PASTA\nAccompanied by a Tomato Olive Compote\nand Northern White Beans with Green Beans\n4 selection of fresh Rolls\nA F\nTE\nR\nALL\nDESSERT\nCranberry Apple Tart\nSTARBUCKS. freshly brewed Coffee\nWe apologize if occasionally your choice is not available.\n202R002.4",
